00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:02,280
I never expected we'd see each other face to face.

275
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:03,640
Neither did I.

276
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:07,560
My closest companion, who shares my sin.

277
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:10,600
There was so much that I wanted to tell you.

278
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:18,020
But first this, he may not listen, but I owe someone an apology.

279
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:26,160
I know this is a selfish thing to ask you, but Yami, please take me to see Julius at once.

280
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:28,380
Of course.

281
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:31,320
The Wizard King.

282
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:46,300
The long battle is finally over.

283
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:50,760
Oh, I've been in so much pain this whole time, I'm gonna die!

284
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:52,760
Oh, you poor thing, that sounds terrible!

285
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:56,280
Maybe you'll remember this next time you're about to do something reckless and stupid.

286
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:59,640
From the bottom of my heart, I can't thank you all enough.

287
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:03,660
The spell has been lifted, despite that devil's best efforts.

288
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:06,240
And with another devil's power, no less.

289
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:11,920
You broke the seal a while ago, and you're just now starting to feel the pain?

290
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:13,560
Quite impressive.

291
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:16,600
By the way, Asta, who are those two people?

292
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:18,060
Who is that man?

293
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:21,900
I know it sounds crazy, but he almost looks like the statue of the first Wizard King come

294
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:22,840
to life or something.

295
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:25,900
Well, I think that's pretty much what happened, actually.

296
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:26,740
Really?

297
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:29,600
You were awakened by magic, right?

298
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:34,240
Oh, man, I can't wait to be a super awesome Wizard King just like you someday!

299
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:35,720
And guess what else?

300
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,180
That's Nero.

301
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:38,300
The bird?

302
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:41,820
Wow, Asta, you must have hit your head pretty hard if you think that.

303
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,020
It's true.

304
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:42,540
What?

305
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:44,060
You know...

306
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:48,400
Dio, I thought you were a pretty cool little bird, but now that I know you can turn yourself

307
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:51,200
into a human, I think you might be the coolest bird that ever lived!

308
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:54,860
I didn't transform into a human, I was a human to begin with.

309
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:57,020
Then why didn't you tell me before?

310
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:01,220
Because up until the Shadow Palace appeared, I wasn't able to talk.

311
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:04,920
Now I have a question to ask you.

312
00:20:05,060 --> 00:20:07,380
What makes you think you can ever hold a candle to his highness?

313
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:10,340
Look, I know we're old pals, but please count that out!

314
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:13,360
So the spunky, adorable Nero is...

315
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:15,600
Well, she's spunky and adorable!

316
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:20,760
Well, to me, Wizard King is nothing but a simple phrase.

317
00:20:20,760 --> 00:20:27,160
But thanks to you and your rival, it's become clear to me that our ideals live on with this

318
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,280
generation as well.

319
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:32,240
Now then, which one of you will take my place?

320
00:20:32,740 --> 00:20:34,480
Oh, that'll be me, sir!

321
00:20:34,660 --> 00:20:36,520
You're nothing compared to him, Asta.

322
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,380
You're mean!

323
00:20:37,380 --> 00:20:45,120
The time has come.

324
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:49,100
I don't have enough magic to hold this body together anymore.

325
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:53,700
My recovery magic can't fix this!

326
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,820
My prince...

327
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:56,260
Secre.

328
00:20:56,900 --> 00:20:58,300
Or Nero, I suppose.

329
00:20:58,940 --> 00:21:00,760
