330
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,000
Watch them make the world better?

331
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:04,360
For my sake?

332
00:21:04,660 --> 00:21:05,820
I've always been...

333
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,600
Well, um...

334
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:08,440
I mean...

335
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:08,820
Anyway...

336
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:10,520
Let me go with you.

337
00:21:11,060 --> 00:21:11,760
Please, sir.

338
00:21:12,100 --> 00:21:14,580
I gave everything 500 years ago.

339
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:16,200
I should have died that day.

340
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:17,820
But then...

341
00:21:17,820 --> 00:21:19,840
You help me protect the future.

342
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:21,540
Let me go.

343
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:25,480
Like I said, I can't let you seal off your potential.

344
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,060
I think the path ahead is a bright one.

345
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:34,240
Both for the magic knights and for the kingdom they'll fight to defend.

346
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:38,520
I even met my descendants.

347
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:40,580
I'm happy.

348
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,340
So am I.

349
00:21:46,640 --> 00:21:47,080
Really.

350
00:21:48,260 --> 00:21:50,240
Serving you for so long, it...

351
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,200
It was an honor.

352
00:21:51,540 --> 00:21:53,500
I was honored to have you.

353
00:21:54,540 --> 00:21:54,920
Secre.

354
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:56,900
Thank you for everything.

355
00:21:57,860 --> 00:21:58,600
You did well.

356
00:21:59,620 --> 00:21:59,920
Goodbye.

357
